      "content": "i put 22 years into this company... everything. the house, the marriage, the savings... it's all just gone. i look in the mirror and i don't even see a person anymore, just a massive mistake. what was even the point of all that effort if it just evaporates like that? feels like i've just been wasting my time for two decades for nothing.",
