      "content": "\"clears the way for something real\"? there's nothing left to clear. i'm 45. i've got no career, no wife, no family left to turn to. i look at the math of my life and it's just constant deficit. i feel like i've been playing a game for twenty years where the rules changed halfway through and i lost everything. it just feels like the investment is totally empty. like there's no point in even trying to rebuild when the total loss is already so high.",
